  "body": "Brand New, Street-Facing & In-Zone!\r\n\r\nSpecs: 4 Bedrooms | 2.5 Bathrooms | Single Garage + Dedicated Laundry + 1 Off-Street Carpark\r\n\r\nPeaceful Cul-de-Sac Living Meets the Vibrant Bay Lifestyle\r\nWelcome to 50 Redwing Street, the flagship premier residence of this stunning new development. Proudly positioned with a commanding street-facing aspect, this beautifully crafted, brand-new home offers the perfect blend of modern luxury, functional family living, and ultimate peace of mind.\r\n\r\nSituated on a quiet, no-exit street, you can escape the hustle and bustle of daily traffic while enjoying a safe environment where kids can play. This is more than just a home; it is your ticket to the highly sought-after Browns Bay lifestyle.\r\n\r\nDesigned for Modern Family Living\r\nStep inside to discover a thoughtfully executed floor plan designed to maximise space, light, and comfort.\r\n• Generous Accommodation: Four spacious bedrooms offer plenty of room for the whole family, or a sun-drenched home office setup.\r\n• Luxury & Convenience: 2.5 elegantly appointed bathrooms (including an ensuite) ease the morning rush, complemented by a dedicated laundry space to keep everyday life organised.\r\n• Ample Parking: A secure single garage plus an additional dedicated off street carpark ensures room for multiple vehicles or visiting guests.\r\n\r\nEducation Excellence – Premium School Zones\r\nFor families prioritising education, this location is an absolute goldmine. Rest easy knowing your children's academic future is secure with access to some of the North Shore’s most prestigious schools:\r\n• Sherwood School\r\n• Murrays Bay Intermediate\r\n• Northcross Intermediate\r\n• Long Bay College\r\n• Rangitoto College\r\n• Plus, proximity to top local early childhood centres, and kindergartens.\r\n\r\nThe Perfect Location: Parks, Malls & Easy Commutes\r\nEverything you need is right at your doorstep. Spend your weekends exploring nearby Freyberg Park and Sherwood Reserve or take a short stroll down to the golden sands of Browns Bay Beach for a morning swim and a coffee at one of the vibrant local cafes.\r\n• Shopping & Lifestyle: Enjoy the ultimate convenience of the Browns Bay town centre, or take a quick drive to the extensive retail, dining, and entertainment hub at Westfield Albany Mall.\r\n• Seamless Transit: With excellent public transport options and nearby bus routes, commuting across the North Shore or into the Auckland CBD is smooth and stress-free.\r\n\r\nWhy Lot 1?\r\nAs the front, street-facing property of the development, Lot 1 boasts the premier position, excellent street appeal, and superb natural light. If you are looking for a pristine, low-maintenance home that ticks every box for school zones, safety, and coastal convenience, this is it.\r\n\r\n**New Build: Title & CCC yet to be issued\r\nDon't miss out on the ultimate Bay-area lifestyle. Contact us today to arrange a\r\nprivate viewing or join us at the upcoming Open Home!",
